{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46961","headline":"酬庐山张处士 · 齐己","name":"酬庐山张处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"发枯身老任浮沉，懒泥秋风更役吟。\n新事向人堪结舌，旧诗开卷但伤心。\n苔牀卧忆泉声遶，麻履行思树影深。\n终谢柴桑与彭泽，醉游闲访入东林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}